<title>UK: Allied Irish Bank sets $150 million 10-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Allied Irish Bank sets $150 million 10-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALLIED IRISH BANKS PLC</p>
<p> AMT	  $150 MLN  SPREAD     +30 BP    MATURITY	 OCT.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    =</p>
<p> PAY DATE   21.OCT.96 ISS PRICE  99.963    FULL FEES   40 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LONODN    DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/IR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC  25 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
